{
  "name": "Top Civitai models of the week to Google Sheets every tuesday",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Top Civitai models of the week to Google Sheets every tuesday\n\nEvery Tuesday, fetch the most downloaded Civitai models of the week for your keywords, with base model, trigger words and download link, and append the rows to a Google Sheet.\n\n### Setup (3 minutes)\n1. **Apify token** - create a free account at apify.com and copy your API token (Settings > API & Integrations).\n   In the **Get Civitai models** node, create a *Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n2. **Google Sheets** node - connect your Google account and paste the URL of an empty sheet. Columns are created from the data automatically.\n3. Edit the JSON body of **Get Civitai models** with your own inputs, then activate the workflow.\n\n**Cost:** $2 per 1,000 models. `maxTotalChargeUsd` in the body is a hard cap per run.\nActor: https://apify.com/om_kh/civitai-scraper",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460
      },
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -540,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "1b580347-1cbe-420a-90e5-1de2ac9dc302"
    },
    {
